WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.980
Glasses are made for one pair
of eyes, and nobody else's.

2
00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:07.180
Borrow a friend's pair,
made to correct myopia,

3
00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.040
and hold a page close.

4
00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:12.020
Close up, the print turns to a blur.

5
00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:15.480
Why can't you read up close
through someone else's glasses?

6
00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:18.870
In this mission, you'll find the
range of vision through a lens,

7
00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.600
one end at a time.

8
00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:24.900
Then you'll design reading glasses
for an eye that cannot focus up close,

9
00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:26.780
and find its new range.

10
00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:31.180
Your mission: explain why you can't read
up close through a friend's glasses made

11
00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:32.210
for myopia.
